WEBVTT

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.530
Is this it?

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:46.120
It's locked.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.140
This is the Eternal Well?

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:08.140
Princess...

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:11.740
My lord?

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:14.400
Princess Naa.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.650
Munenao? It's been a long time.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.900
I've been waiting for you, Princess Naa.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.440
It's been a long time.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.880
The winds I feel are winds of war.

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:33.440
My lord...

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.500
Saizou?

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:39.480
We have just reached the Eternal Well.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:43.890
The time has come for the 
princess to regain her power.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:49.460
Our king will be extremely pleased.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:53.280
However, several stand in the way.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.540
I don't mind...

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.400
Eliminate them.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.320
Yes, sir.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.400
Enough.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.710
You knew from the start, didn't you?

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:16.420
You smell like an insect.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:17.920
Interesting.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.180
<b>My Life's Greatest Task</b>

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.680
Hey, what's going on here?

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.880
It's freezing...

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:40.790
Frozen.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.700
Welcome, everyone.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.500
You've done well to make it this far.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:49.200
You're pretty good.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.390
I am Yuri Kamanosuke, 
of the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:52.400
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Yuri Kamanosuke</b>

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:55.550
And I am Kakei Juuzou, 
of the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:56.210
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Kakei Juuzou</b>

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.760
Now then, there is nothing more to discuss.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.720
All of you, come get me.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:07.010
I shall kill any that would 
oppose Yukimura-sama.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.790
Yup.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.150
But let's have some fun first!

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:13.560
Here I go.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.570
Everyone, I'm sorry I'm late!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.700
You're too early, fool!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.030
Don't kill them before I get a chance!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.200
<i>She blocked it...</i>

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.540
Tamekichi! Matsukichi!

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.700
Hey, Kama, we have two more.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:36.980
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:39.540
An onmyoji?

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.590
This will be even more fun.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.590
I won't let you have any fun!

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.920
Sorry, but I don't like the cold.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.320
I'll finish this quickly.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.730
Then we are similar...

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:55.350
We both dislike the cold, and we 
both used ranged weapons!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.730
Very wrong, everyone.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:06.150
Attacking without a plan is for thoughtless insects.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.030
Oooka-dono!

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:10.560
I have a good grasp of their power and abilities.

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:13.740
We will finish them
before they can shed their skins.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:14.790
Right!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:24.180
So this is Jingaitou, the weapon 
that slew the Eternal Insect...

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.730
Then you were once with the Insect Hunters?

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.570
Why do the Insect Hunters serve the Shogunate?

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.190
I've nothing to say to an insect.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.830
You're weak!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.560
<i>The Insect Hunters...</i>

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:46.950
<i>To slay the Insect Magistrate.</i>

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.880
<i>That is our long-held dream,</i>

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:54.160
<i>and the final service we can 
render to the friends we killed.</i>

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:55.790
<i>Leave it to me.</i>

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.630
<i>Don't screw it up, my little brother.</i>

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.560
<i>Welcome, Insect Hunter.</i>

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:19.720
<i>You were waiting for me?</i>

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:23.080
<i>Hatred leads to more hatred.</i>

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:26.760
<i>Sever the chain here.</i>

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:29.070
<i>Then you are ready to die?</i>

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:33.730
<i>That blade can indeed kill me.</i>

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.460
<i>I've lived a little too long.</i>

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.830
<i>I've nothing left to bind me to this world.</i>

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:56.810
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.310
<i>There was truth in her eyes.</i>

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.820
<i>She was like me.</i>

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.770
<i>Unloved by anyone.</i>

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.270
<i>Loving no one in return.</i>

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:12.570
<i>Only performing the task set before her.</i>

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:21.330
<i>That night, I left the Insect Hunters.</i>

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:26.580
You're one of the stronger of the weaklings.

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.690
This is your reward... Take it!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.240
<i>Dissonant Noise!</i>

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:32.930
<i>If I can defeat the insects, that's enough!</i>

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.100
<i>Jingaitou: Rhino Form...</i>

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.050
<i>Flying Water!</i>

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.930
<i>Jingaitou: Great Waterfall!</i>

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:49.310
Was that Mugai?

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:51.680
And Kirigakure Saizou...

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.660
I knew he survived.

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:57.250
Mugai-dono is fighting...

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.000
I have to do my best, too.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.540
What are you saying, Tsukishima-dono?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.380
Huh?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:06.840
If Mugai-dono is gone, who will 
protect the Magistrate's servant?

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.990
Saizou's kicking butt...

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:16.490
But he revealed the way to break the barrier.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.260
We should hurry.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.910
Oooka-dono, what do we do?

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:24.770
Naturally, our priority is the servant.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.400
Here we go, Juuzou!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.270
Right!

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:28.260
Leave it to me.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.580
Now, you two!

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.820
Tsukishima-dono, quickly...

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.070
<i>Flowering Wind-style Draw: 
Divine Punishment!</i>

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.800
I understand.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:43.210
Then you descended these stairs, my lord.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:49.340
Munenao, I need you to break 
the seal on the Well now.

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:54.470
I've heard the situation from Edo.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.230
However,

00:08:56.230 --> 00:09:00.800
there's no way to know how the Well's 
evil energy will affect you, Princess.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:02.930
It's all right.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.630
That is why we're here.

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:10.080
I must enter the Well and regain 
my power, or Kishuu...

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.860
No, this very country will be in danger.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.500
Very well.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.850
Masachika! Move the rock atop the Well!

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.710
The breath of my king...

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:37.720
At last, the Eternal Well opens.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.740
I'm coming, miss!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.720
Wait for me!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.020
What's wrong, Tsukishima-dono?

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.130
Oooka-dono, do you think Sanada Yukimura

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:52.010
waits at the top of these stairs?

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.490
I'm sorry, Oooka-dono.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:59.650
Please protect the servant on your own.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:03.490
I go now to challenge Sanada Yukimura!

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:05.140
That's wrong.

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.670
Do not be selfish.

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:12.850
But if we defeat Yukimura, 
that also means saving her.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:15.950
And what if you lose?

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.130
I shall continue to win until I die.

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:22.390
No, even if I die, I'll at least slow him down!

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:30.940
While I buy time, you and the servant 
can complete the mission.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.650
I am prepared for a fight.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:36.150
I am always ready for a fight.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.060
That is the samurai's path my father taught me!

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:47.940
Princess Naa...

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:50.460
There's no need for me to remind you,

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:55.420
but this may force you to 
make a painful decision.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.340
Here is what the ancient texts read.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:01.920
"Do not break the seal on the Eternal Well.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:06.130
Only those who have overcome their 
painful pasts will recover their power."

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:09.530
Then if I fail, I shall simply disappear?

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.500
I believe so.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.910
The Well is quite powerful.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:18.020
Your heart's memories will go 
further back, into the past,

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:20.950
taking you to ancient times.

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:23.950
The distant past?

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.250
That's fine.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.400
What is this light?

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.220
The Well has opened.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.410
Tsukishima-dono,

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.430
I shall go to the top floor.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.500
I entrust you

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:58.530
with protecting the servant, 
who will be at that light's source.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.050
But then...

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:05.640
The servant is about to fulfill her task.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:09.290
And it will seriously threaten her life.

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.540
Her life?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.530
You were the one who promised 
to protect her, no matter what,

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.560
Tsukishima-dono.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:21.550
If you do not go now, 
can you see your duty through?

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.050
Very well!

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:30.150
I shall go to the light's source!

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:34.790
So, Oooka-dono, please defeat Sanada!

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:40.010
That is the right decision, Tsukishima-dono.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:44.810
The Insect Magistrate wishes 
for you to protect her.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:48.080
So please do it.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.130
<i>To me, the samurai's path</i>

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:55.010
<i>is following the orders that 
Shogun Yoshimune gives me.</i>

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.990
<i>I do not allow my feelings 
to interfere with my duty.</i>

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:05.140
<i>I'd planned to complete this job like any other.</i>

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:11.350
<i>And so, this situation is very wrong.</i>

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:14.820
<i>This will be the greatest task</i>

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:19.920
<i>in the life of Oooka Echizen no Kamitadasuke.</i>

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:27.670
Are you sure about this?

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:31.100
The Princess is entering the Well.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.870
You have no time to waste on me.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:37.330
Though, of course, you cannot escape me.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.880
<i>Potato-boy?</i>

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.630
<i>Take care of her!</i>

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.100
What's happening, Masachika?

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.120
Th-The poison in the Well...

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:56.510
Munenao, you cannot remain here any longer.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:57.730
I shall go alone.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.850
P-Princess!

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.230
Stop, my lord...

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.670
Staying here is dangerous!

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:11.570
<i>Insect Magistrate...</i>

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:18.250
It seems you have yet to defeat my men, rat.

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:22.170
And if you were to go down there now,

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.460
you would rob your men of 
their chance for glory.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:31.490
Very well.

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:33.430
I shall fight you for a short while.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.060
You may make the first move.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.180
What's wrong?

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.530
Are you not coming?

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.570
Then I shall come to you.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.080
<i>Flowering Wind-style Draw:</i>

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.520
<i>Divine Punishment!</i>

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.580
That's what I was hoping for...

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.910
Apologies, I didn't intend to hit so hard.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.430
<i>He's so much stronger than I am...</i>

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:21.440
Now, time for your second move.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.680
Wh-What's this?

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.290
It stinks...

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.450
Sorry.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.030
I have the body of a stink bug.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:37.750
And you'd best keep fire away 
from this poison gas...

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.540
It's quite flammable.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.300
Time for some fun!

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.200
Matsukichi... Tamekichi!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.340
Get back, kiddo!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.600
Stop messing around, guys.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.100
You can't escape this!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:15.620
<i>If I enter this light, my powers will return.</i>

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.620
<i>But I cannot go forward.</i>

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.900
<i>I cannot move forward...</i>

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:24.120
Miss!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:26.770
Tsukishima?

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:31.080
Tsukishima...

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:34.300
Are you okay, miss?

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:36.360
Yes.

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:38.560
Thank you for coming.

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:50.940
That was an excellent attack.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:55.430
<i>How much time did that attack buy?</i>

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.180
<i>An hour? A minute?</i>

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.950
<i>Or perhaps under a second?</i>

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:04.340
But your next attack is too slow.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.420
You cannot beat me like that!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.700
It's over, then?

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.550
But it was an amusing way to pass time.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.430
Not yet...

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:23.550
That's quite wrong.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.900
You've underestimated your opponent.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:34.250
<i>My task ends when the Magistrate 
recovers her full power.</i>

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:41.160
<i>And that means her poison will 
never let her touch another.</i>

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.390
<i>Or allow them to touch her...</i>

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:49.630
<i>I saw her once, when I was young.</i>

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:55.420
<i>To the Shogunate, she was a mere 
tool for keeping the insects away.</i>

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:58.230
<i>Like a doll without a heart.</i>

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:03.430
<i>She acted as though she didn't care 
for anyone else in the world.</i>

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:08.640
<i>She seemed to accept her fate.</i>

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:12.270
<i>She never changed.</i>

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.070
<i>Neither her appearance, 
nor her empty eyes.</i>

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.320
<i>But when I saw her during this journey,</i>

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.910
<i>she was strong, noble, kind...</i>

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:28.330
<i>She had become someone
 far more human than myself.</i>

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:31.090
<i>I wished to make some memories.</i>

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:34.840
<i>I resolved then</i>

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:40.000
<i>that I would protect her feelings.</i>

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:44.060
<i>So each time I swing this blade,</i>

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:49.010
<i>it buys more time for her 
to be with Tsukishima-dono.</i>

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:53.110
<i>Even if it's for a short time...</i>

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:58.610
<i>If I can ensure it lasts even 
a brief while longer, I...</i>

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.780
<i>I shall continue to swing my sword!</i>

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:11.100
That was a little better.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:14.710
Accept my compliments, samurai.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.720
But cease your useless struggles!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:31.100
Oooka-dono, can you hear me?!

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.680
The servant is safe!

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:38.950
I will protect her from now on, Oooka-dono!

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.770
<i>Tsukishima-dono...</i>

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:51.870
<i>That was right... Tsukishima-dono.</i>

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:56.290
So he died with a smile on his face?

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.640
Stay away!

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:01.290
Okay...

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.470
<i>Repentance Slash!</i>

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:04.930
Got you!

00:20:07.110 --> 00:20:08.180
Did we get them?

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.040
They...

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:14.560
They aren't dead yet.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.220
What is this?

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:20.770
The water of this Well
 is extremely poisonous.

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:25.320
If humans enter, they will suffer, 
screaming, before dying.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:30.250
But if an insect enters, 
they will attain a powerful body,

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.050
becoming invincible.

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:32.830
Huh?

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:35.340
You understand now, right?

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:39.280
What it means if I enter it like this.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:44.990
When we first met, I should 
have told you everything.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.920
And afterward, at Hachijo Island...

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:50.440
And again, on the way here to Kishuu...

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:53.850
I tried to tell you again and 
again, but I could not.

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:55.750
I'm sorry.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:59.020
I loved being with you so much.

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:02.140
What do you mean by tell me everything?

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.660
I have several titles.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:10.880
One of them is quite important to you.

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:15.620
I am not the Insect Magistrate's servant.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.230
I am the real...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:21.240
Princess!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.930
So the time of your awakening 
has finally come, Princess.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:29.890
Sanada Yukimura!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.520
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:02.950
Before you enter the Well, take a deep 
breath and puff out your chest.

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:03.670
Like this?

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:04.400
No.

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:05.190
Like this?

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:06.060
No...

00:23:06.060 --> 00:23:08.070
It doesn't make sense. 
Why isn't her chest sticking out?

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:08.890
Shut up!

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:11.740
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>The Insect Magistrate's Cursed Past</b>

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:14.000
The Insect Magistrate's Cursed Past.
